1
00:00:00,714 --> 00:00:01,734
(Raj:)What?

2
00:00:01,915 --> 00:00:03,215
(Bernadette:)I'm sorry, Raj.

3
00:00:03,383 --> 00:00:05,413
(Raj:)Why can't I find someone?

4
00:00:05,619 --> 00:00:09,059
(Raj:)I'm smart, I've got a cool job
and my naturally bronzed complexion...

5
00:00:09,222 --> 00:00:12,682
(Raj:)...means I can pull off mustard yellow
in a way most guys can't.

6
00:00:13,427 --> 00:00:19,367
- Aw, honey, it's not you, it's them.
- No, it's not. She was too beautiful for me.

7
00:00:19,933 --> 00:00:21,863
- Why would you say that?
- It's true.

8
00:00:22,035 --> 00:00:25,595
(Raj:)I'm always attracted to women I can't have.
I do it all the time.

9
00:00:25,772 --> 00:00:27,742
(Raj:)I did the same thing with the two of you.

10
00:00:28,742 --> 00:00:31,442
(Amy:)The two of them? I don't understand.

11
00:00:32,412 --> 00:00:35,782
(Raj:)Well, uh, there was a time
when I had a thing for Penny.

12
00:00:35,949 --> 00:00:38,609
(Raj:)I thought she was into me too.
She got drunk and naked...

13
00:00:38,785 --> 00:00:42,945
(Raj:)...and climbed into bed with me.
But apparently, I misread those signals.

14
00:00:45,258 --> 00:00:47,188
(Amy:)And you liked Bernadette also?

15
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:48,950
(Raj:)That was before Penny.

16
00:00:49,162 --> 00:00:53,622
(Raj:)I make it a rule to only fall for
one of my friends' girlfriends at a time.

17
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:56,360
(Raj:)I'm very old-fashioned that way.

18
00:00:57,037 --> 00:01:04,027
(Amy:)So at, uh, some point,
you probably had a thing for me too.

